--- a/config.sub
+++ b/config.sub
@@ Modern config.sub maps thumb→arm; we need thumb preserved as its own
@@ CPU for GCC 2.95.3's separate thumb.c backend.
@@
@@ 1. Remove 'thumb' from the strongarm→arm mapping
@@ 2. Add 'thumb' and 'thumbel' to the valid CPU list
@@
@@ Apply to all config.sub files after replacing with modern versions:
@@   find gcc-2.95.3 -name config.sub -exec patch {} < patches/002-config-sub-thumb.patch \;
@@
@@ Or apply the changes manually:
@@   - In the CPU alias section, change:
@@       strongarm-* | thumb-*)  →  strongarm-*)
@@   - In the valid CPU list, add:
@@       | thumb | thumbel \
@@     after the armv* line.
